| engbux.sct 1;1 - scan control tbl, for converting .bru to .brx files
| Fuller description of items can be found in MODEL.SCT
| 1;1 JES: adapt from engbru 1;3 1993-4-7
-ninit 6
0 |   binmod 0 = normal for print->brl & brl->print (text, scanning)
1 | eliminate trailing blanks on line (0=no, 1=yes)
|| | flag char for scan/format controls (note || = ONE vertical bar)
4 | fullstop char for 'sentence' mode
1 |   1=newline treated as space (spacing) (TEX & old TRANSL)
 | ff is ignored without warning
P | par insert
3 | $par (on either) in effect initially
1 | 1 = rejoin at all line-ending hyphens
0 | 0 = compress spaces
2 | number of spaces to expand tabs to (-1 = tabs are errors)(<= 9999)
0 |   ninmod 0 = normal (word scanning) for prt->brl & brl->prt
1 |   1 = yes flatten controls, downcase
1 |   1 = yes flatten ord'y words, downcase
0 |   0 = normal cease u.c. (only end of word)
1 | 1 = `{|}~ DO map to @[\]^ (e.g. for VB1) when upcasing
 | (spare)
 | (spare)
 | nsnqt - input flag for quoted word (nil: no quoting)
|028 | nsoqt - output flag for quoted word
|029 | nsofm - output flag for whole-word format word
|030 | nsof2 - output flag for 2-char format word
 | nsocp - capitalization flag output
 | nsotn - cap termination flag output
 | (spare)
running
spacing
marking
as-is
compress
sentence
auto-tab
par
no-par
par-skp
par-ind
 | (spare)
 | (spare)
*** | required table terminator
